\textbf{Tiebreak Strategy} & \textbf{Accuracy (\%)} & \textbf{$p$-value} \\
\midrule
SICA (MAX-SAT) & 78 & 0.003 \\
SC-Alphabetical & 55 & --- \\
SC-Longest-Chain & 52 & --- \\
SC-Random & 50 & --- \\
